# TASK-260715-135rr8 rev2 tester outcome

## Exact candidate

- Candidate tree OID: `24a9d147e2464f1157ef10eb6ef3ed51dae2b5e5`.
- Repaired Story baseline: `89d9c6425dde28709aca492de32943407d9b67bb`.
